# PicEdit

A professional-grade, non-destructive RAW photo editor for desktop systems, built with Python, PySide6 (Qt6), OpenCV, and LibRaw (via rawpy). PicEdit prioritizes real-time responsiveness through a modular pipeline architecture featuring sub-millisecond Look-Up Table (LUT) acceleration, enabling sustained 60 FPS interactive feedback during tone adjustments.

